==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[multiplication]] [[table]]}}

# {{context|arithmetic|lang=en}} A [[table]] showing the [[product]]s of each of the [[integer]]s from 1 to 10 (or, especially formerly, 12) with each of the integers from 1 to 10 (or 12).

